ripple-manifest.json: @ripple-ui/svelte 0.8.0 manifest, vendored from qbtrix/ripple-iui
branch feat/play-wave (illustration, bill-split and the button's choice-card icon and
description, plus memory-match, word-guess, quiz, habit-tracker, focus-timer,
board-game and the illustration's annotations) at 1b218f7, pending a release.
It is that commit's packages/svelte/static/manifest.json (generatedAt
2026-10-09T21:00:37.569Z, 205 widgets, upstream sha256
3e4657f3b0eabcdb2831f8e2b8f7ea8a704b0aa14279698b3673d289ca059e8c), with every
widget's "example" removed. One entry is newer: "model-viewer" is
the one from branch feat/3d-widget at db6cd37 (its static/manifest.json, generatedAt
2026-10-11T18:48:57.273Z: asset, annotations, focus and on_select), swapped in alone
because a full refresh from there changes 35 other widgets this slice does not touch.
Two entries are added the same way, each alone: "notes" from branch feat/notes-widget
at e402715 (qbtrix/ripple-iui#218, generatedAt 2026-10-12T04:44:27.731Z, upstream
sha256 00823d14b2b5e92b4fbfe51b197b9fd42d53d35091214685be1e950a6cf5dbfa) and
"music-player" from branch feat/music-player at 820fcbd (#217, generatedAt
2026-10-12T04:42:27.975Z, upstream sha256
a20b933cdaf41a27d081717e3017ab42969f5be93b3b9e8c9321ce1b2e71db30), each placed after
the widget that precedes it upstream (207 widgets). Six data widgets are added the
same way: "agenda", "week-schedule" and "weather-forecast" from branch
feat/forecast-schedule-agenda at 041ec69 (#224, generatedAt 2026-10-12T05:46:37.164Z,
upstream sha256 7faf9a1b180c0d071f83c6776c0ff5abcdacf63ff480c933608e0b33f011a2ea),
after board-game; "place-results", "product-grid" and "media-grid" from branch
feat/places-products-media at 4500074 (#223, generatedAt 2026-10-12T05:39:54.325Z,
upstream sha256 2058fe56281a94ed056bb2c5ee760259aa31ca0c0fc194d9f8f1a161b4685205),
after notes (213 widgets). interval-workout's optional
per-exercise "figure" (#216) is not pulled: nothing here checks exercise rows, and the
widget matches figures by name. The server never reads the examples, and one carries a
sample Stripe-style key that GitHub push protection refuses.

Refresh (once the data widgets ship in a release, use the release asset):
  gh release download -R qbtrix/ripple-iui --pattern manifest.json -D <dir>
  (until then: packages/svelte/static/manifest.json at the PR head, after
  `bun run build:manifest` if it is stale)
  python -I - <dir>/manifest.json ee/pocketpaw_ee/paw_bar/ripple-manifest.json <<'PY'
  import json, sys
  m = json.load(open(sys.argv[1], encoding="utf-8"))
  for w in m["widgets"]:
      w.pop("example", None)
  open(sys.argv[2], "w", encoding="utf-8").write(json.dumps(m, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False) + "\n")
  PY
then update this file and the pins in test_the_vendored_ripple_manifest_has_not_drifted
(tests/cloud/test_paw_bar_ripple_profile.py: _RIPPLE_MANIFEST_SHA256, version, count).
